---
import WorkLayout from '../../layouts/WorkLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';

const description = 'தட்பம் (Thatpam): a solo ed-tech experiment by Mariappan Subramanian to experience startup life and teach what he loves. Owned everything from pixels to payments.';
---
<WorkLayout
  title="தட்பம் (Thatpam)"
  description={description}
  heading="தட்பம்"
  headingLang="ta"
  facts={[
    { label: 'Role', value: 'Founder, designer, engineer' },
    { label: 'Stack', value: 'React, Storybook, Tailwind CSS, Radix UI' },
    { label: 'Status', value: 'Cohorts paused' },
  ]}
  link={{ href: 'https://thatpam.netlify.app/', label: 'thatpam.netlify.app' }}
  schema={{
    name: 'தட்பம் (Thatpam)',
    alternateName: 'Thatpam',
    url: 'https://thatpam.netlify.app/',
    description: 'A solo ed-tech experiment to experience startup life and teach what I love. Owned everything from pixels to payments.',
    inLanguage: ['ta', 'en'],
    keywords: 'ed-tech, React, Storybook, Tailwind CSS, Radix UI',
  }}
>
  <Fragment slot="lede"><span lang="ta">திறமைக்கு மொழி தடை இல்லை</span>. A solo ed-tech experiment to experience startup life and teach what I love. Owned everything from <mark class="hl">pixels to payments</mark>.</Fragment>

  <h2>The idea</h2>
  <p>Talent shouldn't be gated by the language a course happens to be taught in. தட்பம் set out to teach front-end craft in Tamil, live, in small cohorts, by someone who actually ships it for a living.</p>

  <h2>What I owned</h2>
  <ul class="doodle-list">
    <li>Brand, landing page and course design, in Figma and in code.</li>
    <li>The learning experience: cohort structure, live sessions, assignments and feedback loops.</li>
    <li>Payments, onboarding emails and the boring-but-essential operations around them.</li>
  </ul>

  <!--
    Adding media: drop files into public/images/work/thatpam/ and use one of these.

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/work/thatpam/landing.png" alt="Describe what the image shows" width="1600" height="1000" loading="lazy">
      <figcaption>Landing page, first cohort</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <figure>
      <video src="/images/work/thatpam/demo.mp4" poster="/images/work/thatpam/demo-poster.jpg" controls playsinline preload="none" width="1600" height="900"></video>
      <figcaption>Walkthrough of the cohort dashboard</figcaption>
    </figure>
  -->

  <h2>What stayed with me</h2>
  <blockquote>Cohorts are paused, but the learnings are permanent.</blockquote>
  <p>Running everything solo is the fastest way to learn which parts of a product people actually feel. More detailed notes are on the way.</p>

  <aside class="callout wobbly wobbly--2" aria-label="Note">
    <Icon name="lightbulb" />
    <p>This page is a living write-up. Screenshots, numbers and a proper retrospective will land here soon.</p>
  </aside>
</WorkLayout>
